### GET AN USER (requires authentication)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/4d8cc8ae-2d96-4856-aecf-677be6ccdcd5 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer e54ce53c-ba84-4812-aa16-3ef29baf88c5

### LOGOUT AN USER 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/logout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer cb60fd9d-3eb9-4189-8e53-6d01670e1e09

### UPDATE AN USER
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/users/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer e54ce53c-ba84-4812-aa16-3ef29baf88c5
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "email": "betsy@icloud.com",
   "name": "Betsy",
   "surname": "Lima",
   "displayName": "KeoLima",
   "password": "123456",
   "city": "Lyon",
   "avatarUrl": null
}

### CREATE AN USER
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "email": "keomalima@icloud.com",
   "name": "Keoma",
   "surname": "Lima",
   "password": "123456",
   "displayName": "KeoLimaa",
   "city": "Lyon",
   "avatarUrl": null
}

### LOGIN AN USER
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "email": "keomalima@icloud.com",
   "password": "123456"
}

### DELETES AN USER
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/users HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer 7db89ffe-7d68-42fd-ba86-546be971eda8